   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Fixed when the call opens, and the same as in writing: the Darbar text\n(the environment: calls, writing, a cut reply ending in \"…\", late tool\nresults), then the gem's name and its own instructions (by default, how to\ntalk in a call and how to write). Nothing depends on the tools offered.\nNothing says when to search: the tool's description does. No date.",
   "originalText": "Fixed when the call opens, and the same as in writing: the Darbar text\n(the environment: calls, writing, a cut reply ending in \"…\", late tool\nresults), then the gem's name and its own instructions (by default, how to\ntalk in a call and how to write). Nothing depends on the tools offered.\nNothing says when to search: the tool's description does. No date.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
